{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0364_1000_p", "source_sha256": "26f75e2c345af47aebad60c9b9c287f998b916fc24a354b01cf44f60ded7110c", "ja": "（とあるオフの日。海美と紅葉を見にやってきた！\nお弁当も作ってきたらしいが……様子が少しおかしい）", "zh": "（某个休息日。和海美一起出来看红叶！\n听说她还做了便当带来，不过……样子有点奇怪。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0364_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "2924e78e7a60d7816ee40be2bc08542da2b667b8f84636b37664bf482649e99a", "ja": "わ、わあ～。すごいね、{$P$}。\n葉っぱの色が変わって、すっかり秋って感じ……ね？", "zh": "哇、哇～好厉害呢，{$P$}。\n叶子都变了颜色，完全就是秋天的感觉了……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0364_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f5d7cebd0d397d060fe99157147d6b67eaf969b76dd347bb4122c223cd078d44", "ja": "……そうだな。綺麗に色づいてるな。", "zh": "……是啊。树叶染上了美丽的色彩呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0364_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "958421e13b49ad98995f34dcad5f42aa1d7f6251e981ab616e032354a238b4e9", "ja": "紅葉といえば……今日の服、どうかな？\n店員さんのオススメコーデ、なんだけど……。", "zh": "说到红叶……你觉得我今天这身怎么样？\n这是店员推荐的搭配……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0364_1004_p", "source_sha256": "85c9b96cdbcc9168c4147a2d18f7e84716c7aa07abe07485fcce3a672ffbb28e", "ja": "あ、ああ……。\nいつもより大人っぽくて、似合ってると思うよ。", "zh": "啊，啊啊……\n比平时更有成熟感，我觉得很适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0364_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "ea4ddcd79cd0d7723dd1169684d384ee06225f30520e48accfe5f96824b14ce7", "ja": "え、えへへへへ……そっかぁ～！　よ、よかった～。\nあっ！　……わ、私、今日楽しみだったの！", "zh": "诶、诶嘿嘿嘿嘿……这样啊～！太、太好了～。\n啊！……我、我今天一直很期待呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0364_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c8e3668b829be15bef6a9414e0bde0147cfa972e8c5e6c38bbf3bc60537bda79", "ja": "なあ、海美……。\nなんだか、無理してないか？", "zh": "海美……你是不是有点勉强自己了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0364_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "0c20e387950bec2af3f4e6d10d6e0307229177fb6f91310d21509027a53cc67e", "ja": "えっ！？　や、やだな、{$P$}！\n無理なんて全然……全然……。", "zh": "诶！？才、才没有呢，{$P$}！\n我一点都没有勉强……一点都没有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0364_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "1a139926c70240b7892fd7c544b51775c2105b579c0bd38fadfd741c25861b9c", "ja": "……ごめんなさい。すっごく無理してます。\nね、ねえ？　やっぱり変だった？", "zh": "……对不起。我确实硬撑得很厉害。\n那、那个……果然看起来很奇怪吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0364_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0c921a93f6887ba2da442f3dff839889962fa85b3d30a56d2faaad2acc54a9d5", "ja": "変というか、ぎこちないって感じかな。\n海美、何かあったのか？", "zh": "与其说是奇怪，不如说是有点僵硬吧。\n海美，发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0364_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "bd6cb195f06ebaa6e13c9c20bea4cbcbd7a8d4111d3ae39efb2232b324e1167e", "ja": "うう～。{$P$}とのお出かけだし、\n服とかお弁当とか、気合いいれたんだ……。", "zh": "呜呜～。毕竟是和{$P$}一起出门，\n所以在衣服和便当之类的事上，都很鼓足了劲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0364_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "068a5e98beed0225faac8886cb864fce689c64bdb3c9443cdb84f3939b8c40af", "ja": "でも、寝る前に思ったの。こんなにはしゃいでたら、\n子どもみたいで恥ずかしいかも……って。", "zh": "可是，我在睡觉前突然想到，要是这么兴奋的话，会不会像个小孩子一样，很丢人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0364_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1ffddcaf58be7083bf75d2b0f5fef793dd99033ecd85147d1f1f4421b8568411", "ja": "な、なるほど。でも悪いことじゃないぞ？\nそれだけ楽しみにしてたってことだし……。", "zh": "原、原来如此。不过这也不是什么坏事吧？这不正说明你有多期待嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0364_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "3a7d6fa46afdc1ccb408993d8940e2e6480a38db916b16759440b202d5208dd5", "ja": "そうだけど、でもダメなの～！　今日はビシッとした\nキレイでスマートな女子でいるって決めたんだもん！", "zh": "是这样没错，可是还是不行啦～！我已经决定今天要当一个干练、漂亮又时髦的女生了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0364_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e6dc68c267ffb3067aebc6e6de09263e65fb2ce4f9a8d985bb7e2d4d6d7cf5c1", "ja": "キレイでスマートな女子を目指して、\n逆にぎこちなくなったってわけか……。", "zh": "也就是说，为了成为漂亮又干练的女生，反而变得不自然了啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0364_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "ff6291187de0dc297959e11fe4461c90051915ececdbbf4f442ceb7c2501419f", "ja": "{$P$}だって、\n紅葉で喜ぶなんて、子どもっぽいって思うでしょ？", "zh": "连{$P$}也觉得，\n看到红叶就高兴成这样，很像小孩子吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0364_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9a4c51038cb0f9a19b590efe0cbeceb14e94a40020df2a7f9ebf433af848ccb9", "ja": "いや、そんなことないぞ！　俺だって、\n今日が楽しみで、なかなか寝付けなかったからな。", "zh": "不，才不是那回事！我也很期待今天，兴奋得都迟迟睡不着了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0364_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "9baa12f4fe281d480c941b59c70fb4cf64ccf86e5d0b646438cabf1dc0610717", "ja": "そうなの！？　私も私も！　布団にはいっても\n全然眠れなくて……寝たと思ったら、もう朝だったの！", "zh": "是这样！？我也是我也是！躺进被窝后完全睡不着……好不容易以为睡着了，结果天都亮了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0364_1018_p", "source_sha256": "48a2522d9dcf78d0aa95f2b3906c352904e016903e476ac9a6aa1ec15d8fc47e", "ja": "ははっ、そうそう。はしゃぐのは大人だって同じだよ。\n海美の弁当、ずっと楽しみにしてたんだ。", "zh": "哈哈，对对。大人也一样会兴奋啊。\n我一直都很期待海美做的便当。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0364_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "d2f930c13dd1dad6f18724da411e272872807ea5d3eee38b51f14e923564ca1c", "ja": "ホント！？　あんまり期待されると自信ないけど……。\nでもでも、頑張って作ったから楽しみにしてて♪", "zh": "真的！？你这么期待，我都有点没自信了……  \n不过不过，我可是很努力做出来的，所以要期待一下哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0364_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "2ca466462ab8065e26bddfe0614154ce1fce455507316c3c9472ffcdc389270b", "ja": "よーしっ！　ここからは、いつもの私で楽しむぞ～！\n待ってて、秋のピクニック！　うみみんダーッシュ☆", "zh": "好～嘞！接下来我要和平时一样好好享受啦～！\n等我呀，秋季野餐！海美美冲刺☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0364_1021_p", "source_sha256": "cc3ac490ca7bdccb6e5e36e7e63a23e82dce2047859c71abb28cf07b7b60b1d0", "ja": "海美！？　落ち葉で滑ると危ないから！\nお、おい海美ーっ！！", "zh": "海美！？踩到落叶滑倒会很危险的！  \n喂、海美——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0364_1022_p", "source_sha256": "b0f0d6ff799fb5df3cc592af758fe1ab8aba7981a7f80e65ebcc5e2bc6cb38d3", "ja": "（海美が元気を取り戻してよかった……。俺も今日は\n全力で楽しむぞ！　って、海美を追いかけないと！？）", "zh": "（海美能恢复精神真是太好了……我今天也要尽情享受！等等，我得追上海美才行！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
